00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:14,000
So this is about 240 generations.

292
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:41,000
And if you think about how long humans
have been around in the context of the
history of the Earth, the history of human
ancestors, and even when you think of your
own place in that history, and not just in
the history of the Earth and the history
of human ancestors, but also within the
context of human history itself with our
own species.

293
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:46,000
Your existence amounts to a tiny piece of
nothing.

