a trade or take a trade off, as in to take
an action in the financial markets.

295
00:36:56,000 --> 00:37:00,000
Think about that in this context.

296
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:03,000
It is a totally meaningless action.

297
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:19,000
So just think of the approach that many
